<title>FRANCE: Tunisian president to visit France.</title>
<headline>Tunisian president to visit France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian president Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali is expected to visit France this autumn, Tunisian Prime Minister Hamed Karoui said in Paris on Friday.</p>
<p>Karoui was speaking after talks with President Jacques Chirac. Ben Ali's visit was tentatively scheduled for this month but was postponed because of France's forthcoming general election.</p>
